{"server":"cn","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_06_end","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_06","title":"旧日碾轧","storyCode":"IS-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"ef8b85efb6f6f95badd3ea3b1ec82326d60a2062abe9645a5d5e0345432c3092","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"撤退，这家伙很棘手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不要和她硬来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"守住通往首领的包厢的走道和楼梯口！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，罗塞蒂的人还挺能干嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要强行突破看起来不太现实啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，德克萨斯这家伙，明明是在贝斯里装了录音器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弹得还挺像那么一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正面突破不行的话......那就造一条路出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"别慌张！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"守住这里！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，这些家伙，不怕死吗！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"咕......啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人的情况如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通往乔万娜包厢的各个走道和楼梯口都被守住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的准备很充分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是罗塞蒂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我们从一开始就没有小看乔万娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续投入人力，今天，乔万娜必须留在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们或许没有小看乔万娜，但是不是有点太小看我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......瓦拉赫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，早知道今天演的是这样一出好戏，我就不费劲去给首领拿酒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔万娜小姐要是对酒感兴趣，我这里倒也有一些好货。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首领喜欢叙拉古的许多东西，但唯独叙拉古的酒，总是喝不惯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叙拉古的酒，太软，就和你们挥动武器的力道一样，让人提不起劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那或许是你们还没有喝过叙拉古真正的好酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，这不就是最好的机会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们知道我等这个机会等很久了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝洛内和萨卢佐，让我尝尝吧，叙拉古的好酒，到底是什么味道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"想从这里上去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"拦住她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁告诉你，我要上去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"什么，炸药？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"散开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇，那边的看台塌下来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是——拉普兰德？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的观众","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看那边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的观众","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"难、难道说是家族仇杀......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"她、她竟然把武器藏在乐器里？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯！"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克萨斯没有说话，只是看了她一眼，张了张嘴，然后就向楼上冲去。\n空辨认出了她的口型。\n她说：等我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的观众","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噫——快、快跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办，能天使，空会有危险的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的观众","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救、救命——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趴下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，老爷爷你好厉害啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看起来很老吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......倒也没到那个地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，今天上演的，并不是《德克萨斯之死》，而是《罗塞蒂之殇》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，去避难吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......虽然我们也想这么做，但是，我们的朋友还在舞台上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可舞台周围已经乱成一团了，我们直接冲过去太危险了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就走后台！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，别拦路！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，勇敢的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，老爷爷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后请你吃披萨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，年轻人总是充满了活力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，你打算怎么做呢，乔万娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"首领，各个路口现在都在我们的掌控中，您趁现在离开这里吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难得有个能好好观赏这场好戏的地方，我自然要尽兴才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空，你果然是她的朋友吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要从那里上来吗，切利尼娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，就算有了捷径，想要到我这里来，也不会那么轻松的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你认为，我现在逃跑之后，贝洛内和萨卢佐就会放过我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是开战，亲爱的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝洛内和萨卢佐无视了西西里夫人的禁令，选择了对另外一个家族全面开战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"传话下去，我们能做的，只有——和他们对抗到底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，叙拉古的好酒，也不过如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥伦比亚杂碎......少得意了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我知道，在你们叙拉古人眼里，我们这些哥伦比亚家族全都是没有积淀的暴发户。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥伦比亚那边这样的蠢货确实有许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你们呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在所谓的“铳与秩序”之下，你们的血性又剩下多少呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来没有小看过叙拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在看来，至少你们这些人，没有什么值得我看重的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦拉赫，剧院那边出状况了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"有人把看台炸了下来，切利尼娜直接去三楼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你五秒钟说遗言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遗言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，哪有什么遗言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真有这个工夫，帮我和莱昂图索说一声抱歉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会用我的方式顾全大局，德米特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂图索大少爷，我还以为，我们之间能够愉快相处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从现在开始也不是没有机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧，大家族出来的人气度就是不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骑到我的头上来了，还告诉我，还有机会挽回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事已至此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来打个赌吧，瓦拉赫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打赌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈，我的莱昂大少爷，这里不是宴会场，也不是办公室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是战场，我们在这里只有你死我活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，这是个你会喜欢的赌约。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，罗塞蒂家族的人，真是难缠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官阁下？我们没有收到你会参与这次行动的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，这不是你能够介入的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不想妨碍你们，现在，我也没有那个兴趣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在找人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在剧院里很乱，恐怕没有你要找的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们只要别来妨碍我就可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我死在这里，也和贝洛内家族无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是这里的工作人员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"工作人员？工作人员早就被我们赶走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，为什么他会在那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当心，丹——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血液飞溅，有几滴洒到了拉维妮娅脸上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎么会在这里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉普兰德开辟的“道路”十分有效，还有一小段路，她就可以见到她的老朋友。\n她微微呼出一口气。\n场面一片混乱，但她知道自己想做什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你果然来了，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在的眼神很好，让我感觉我像一个猎物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我见识见识你有多大的能耐吧，最后的德克萨斯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......总监阁下，这场混乱......也是演出的一环吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混乱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看来，一切都井然有序，卢比奥部长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而接下来，正要渐入佳境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您领导的不愧是沃尔西尼最负盛名的剧团之一，这样别开生面的剧目我是头一次见到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，接下来，是中场休息时间，现在，你可以说一说，你想从我这里获得什么了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要的东西......不复杂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉奇死后，建设部部长的人选一直悬而未决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必您也一直在挑选合适的人选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想说，你就是那个人选？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事实上，我认为没有比我更合适的人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳，呕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种时候还有力气手下留情......真是了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不动手吗，萨卢佐家的疯子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不想和一个从一开始就没打算用全力的家伙进行无意义的厮杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在等什么，你在期待什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和人打了一个赌，我希望我赌输了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"瓦拉赫看向德克萨斯离去的方向，没有人能阻碍德克萨斯刺杀乔万娜。\n除了乔万娜自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"narration","text":"房间内空无一人。\n德克萨斯立刻意识到发生了什么，然而为时已晚，一把刀架在了她的脖子上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自从来到叙拉古之后，我设想过无数种被人刺杀的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯独没有想过，会是你走到我的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，居然在这个时候放松了警惕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道以为——只要见到我，我就会抱抱你，说，“切利尼娜，太好了，你真的没死”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后我们可以坐下喝一杯，聊一聊过去几年发生的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是来杀你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"narration","text":"这么说着，乔万娜却放下了手中的刀。\n她的脸上笑意盈盈，神情中满怀思念，像是刚才的杀意只是一个小小的玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，乔万娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
